# P13-005: ATTACH any catalog kind, by prefix or path

Make `ATTACH ... (TYPE pfile_catalog)` work for **every** catalog kind — single-fileset
(v1), multi-file / sharded (v1), and matrix (v2) — and let the path be a **prefix**, not
only the full `.pfile.json`. So `ATTACH 'dir/cohort'` finds `dir/cohort.pfile.json`, and a
plain sharded cohort or a single fileset attaches as the same schema of relations the matrix
already exposes.

Depends on: P13-003 (the matrix ATTACH surface, merged as #82 — `src/pfile_catalog_storage.cpp`).
Revives P11-001 (attach a single fileset), which P13-003 superseded for the matrix only.
Branch: `feature/P13-005-attach-all-kinds`.

## Status

- [ ] Owner decision D1: a bare fileset with no `.pfile.json` sidecar (§6)
- [ ] Owner decision D2: the relation set for the degenerate kinds (§5)
